{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204320","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1220432001:0":{"text":"괜찮나? 걱정 마, 네 오빠가 나쁜 놈들을 다 쫓아냈으니까.","source_cn":"你还好吧，小姑娘？别怕，你哥哥已经把坏人都打跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x367A94186325A888","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220432002:0":{"text":"음... 저, 전 괜찮아요. 우리 오빠는 아주 대단한 복싱 선수예요!","source_cn":"嗯……我、我没事。我哥哥是最厉害的拳击手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33D50C1EDFCF2E88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220432003:0":{"text":"웬디, 무사해서 다행이야! 루카 님, 감사합니다...","source_cn":"温蒂，你没事就太好了！卢卡先生，谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x923ACF1F0F37E69E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220432004:0":{"text":"스탠턴, 이 일이 마무리될 때까지 네 여동생은 우리 블러디 로즈에 머무는 게 좋겠어.","source_cn":"小子，这件事结束前，你妹妹就住在我们血薇帮的地方了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEF2C1916E1D337F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220432005:0":{"text":"네? 하지만...","source_cn":"啊？可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x114E05AE8A932658","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220432006:0":{"text":"하지만은 없어. 내가 그녀의 안전을 보장하지. 넌 다음 시합을 준비에 몰두해. 그리고 꼭 이겨.","source_cn":"没有可是，我来保证她的安全。你全力准备下一场拳赛，要赢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74BBDC663B470C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220432007:0":{"text":"하지만 제겐 희망이 없어요. 누가 승부 조작을 하는 선수와 프로 계약을 하고 싶겠어요?","source_cn":"可我已经没希望了，谁会愿意签约一个打假拳的职业拳手呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB31083D98F14AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220432008:0":{"text":"그건 모르는 일이지.","source_cn":"那可不一定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F1DB85029BD5D6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220432009:0":{"text":"너를 영입하고 싶어 했던 그 레오프론 브로커는 지금 어디에 있지?","source_cn":"小子，之前你说，有个耀光来的拳击掮客想招你。他在哪儿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E8781A4DE9330F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220432010:0":{"text":"그 사람이요? 전 그 사람이 <style=\"highlight\">광장 구역</style> 근처에 자주 나타난다는 것 말곤 아는 게 없어요.","source_cn":"他？我只知道他经常在<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE96A27BD30728F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220432011:0":{"text":"루카 님, 무얼 하시려고요?","source_cn":"卢卡先生，你想做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F051082618AC059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220432012:0":{"text":"그만 물어봐. 넌 내가 시키는 대로 다음 시합에서 꼭 이기도록 해. 알겠나?","source_cn":"别问那么多，照我说的做就是。赢下拳赛，记住了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A16AAE786055051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220432013:0":{"text":"알겠어요... 웬디, 오빠가 시합에서 이기면 바로 널 데리러 갈게, 알겠지?","source_cn":"好吧……温蒂，等哥哥打赢了拳赛就去接你，好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E6CBB368F3CF381","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220432014:0":{"text":"응!","source_cn":"嗯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA07B11A7B13D906","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"루카","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:温蒂":{"text":"웬디","source":"温蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:地下拳手斯坦顿":{"text":"권투 선수 스탠턴","source":"地下拳手斯坦顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}